{"id":"5edfa66c6abe1ecc","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-weil-ii.md","title":"Weil II Weight Purity","display":"df-weil-ii — Weil II Weight Purity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weil-ii","aliases":["58-df-weil-ii"],"display":"df-weil-ii — Weil II Weight Purity","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-weil-conjectures.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weil-ii"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weil-ii</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weil-ii — Weil II Weight Purity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6a4271733f0e0d4\" href=\"?note=e6a4271733f0e0d4\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-weil-conjectures.md\">../batch16/58-df-weil-conjectures.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03f2d34d9851bee4\" href=\"?note=03f2d34d9851bee4\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md\">../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,q,\\ell,d,p,a\\in V\">\\(X,q,\\ell,d,p,a\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为素数谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothProjectiveVariety}_{\\mathbb F_q}(X,d)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothProjectiveVariety}_{\\mathbb F_q}(X,d)\\)</span>（定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F_q\">\\(\\mathbb F_q\\)</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 维光滑射影簇谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline X_q\\coloneqq X\\times_{\\mathbb F_q}\\overline{\\mathbb F}_q\">\\(\\overline X_q\\coloneqq X\\times_{\\mathbb F_q}\\overline{\\mathbb F}_q\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Frob}_q\">\\(\\mathrm{Frob}_q\\)</span>（作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X,\\mathbb Q_\\ell)\">\\(H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X,\\mathbb Q_\\ell)\\)</span> 上的几何 Frobenius）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureWeight}_S,\\mathrm{WeilII}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{PureWeight}_S,\\mathrm{WeilII}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本原子定义的权重与 Weil II 谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}weight}\\vdash \\mathrm{PureWeight}_S(H,F,q,w)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\land w\\in\\mathbb Z\\land F\\in H^H\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Spec}(F)\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha\\in\\overline{\\mathbb Q}\\land\\forall\\iota:\\overline{\\mathbb Q}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl|\\iota(\\alpha)\\bigr|=q^{w/2}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}weight}\\vdash \\mathrm{PureWeight}_S(H,F,q,w)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\land w\\in\\mathbb Z\\land F\\in H^H\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Spec}(F)\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha\\in\\overline{\\mathbb Q}\\land\\forall\\iota:\\overline{\\mathbb Q}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl|\\iota(\\alpha)\\bigr|=q^{w/2}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}ii}\\vdash \\mathrm{WeilII}_S(X,q,\\ell,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(\\ell)\\land\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land q=p^a\\land\\ell\\neq p\\land\\operatorname{SmoothProjectiveVariety}_{\\mathbb F_q}(X,d)\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(i\\leq2d\\to\\mathrm{PureWeight}_S(H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X_q,\\mathbb Q_\\ell),\\mathrm{Frob}_q\\upharpoonright H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X_q,\\mathbb Q_\\ell),q,i)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}ii}\\vdash \\mathrm{WeilII}_S(X,q,\\ell,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(\\ell)\\land\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land q=p^a\\land\\ell\\neq p\\land\\operatorname{SmoothProjectiveVariety}_{\\mathbb F_q}(X,d)\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(i\\leq2d\\to\\mathrm{PureWeight}_S(H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X_q,\\mathbb Q_\\ell),\\mathrm{Frob}_q\\upharpoonright H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X_q,\\mathbb Q_\\ell),q,i)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Deligne 的 Weil II 定理说明上述光滑射影情形中的谓词成立；本原子只固定其精确语义。</li>\n<li>对一般有限型簇，上同调是混合的，应使用递增权重滤过；该滤过不能无条件写成规范直和分解。</li>\n<li>纯权 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 给出 Frobenius 特征值的绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q^{i/2}\">\\(q^{i/2}\\)</span>，即 Weil 猜想中的 Riemann–Hypothesis 型界。</li>\n<li>特征素数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>、指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 与维数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 现在全部在谓词参数或量词中绑定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=p^a\">\\(q=p^a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 的素性及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\neq p\">\\(\\ell\\neq p\\)</span> 也都是断言内条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-weil-conjectures.md","status":"resolved","id":"e6a4271733f0e0d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-weil-conjectures.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"03f2d34d9851bee4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,q,\\ell,d,p,a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothProjectiveVariety}_{\\mathbb F_q}(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F_q","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline X_q\\coloneqq X\\times_{\\mathbb F_q}\\overline{\\mathbb F}_q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Frob}_q","display":false},{"tex":"H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X,\\mathbb Q_\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PureWeight}_S,\\mathrm{WeilII}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pure\\text{-}weight}\\vdash \\mathrm{PureWeight}_S(H,F,q,w)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\land w\\in\\mathbb Z\\land F\\in H^H\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Spec}(F)\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha\\in\\overline{\\mathbb Q}\\land\\forall\\iota:\\overline{\\mathbb Q}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb C\\;\\bigl|\\iota(\\alpha)\\bigr|=q^{w/2}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weil\\text{-}ii}\\vdash \\mathrm{WeilII}_S(X,q,\\ell,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(\\ell)\\land\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land q=p^a\\land\\ell\\neq p\\land\\operatorname{SmoothProjectiveVariety}_{\\mathbb F_q}(X,d)\\land\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(i\\leq2d\\to\\mathrm{PureWeight}_S(H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X_q,\\mathbb Q_\\ell),\\mathrm{Frob}_q\\upharpoonright H^i_{\\mathrm{\\acute et}}(\\overline X_q,\\mathbb Q_\\ell),q,i)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"q^{i/2}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"q=p^a","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\neq p","display":false}],"bytes":2323,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1385","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-weil-ii.md|58-df-weil-ii]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["e6a4271733f0e0d4","03f2d34d9851bee4","3322615e4eea05e9"]}